\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro retreats, deja vu feeling creeps in. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Shinichi Kishima \par \uc2 534 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Januar 2000\par 14:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Jan 3 (Reuters) - The euro shed most of its early gains on Monday as optimism on the European economy subsided, prompting a deja vu feeling about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which fell 14 percent against the dollar last year after a dashing debut. \par \par \uc2  The euro rallied to two-week highs in Asia to start its second year of trading, bolstered by hopes that Europe's growth could outpace U.S. growth this year, but failed to sustain the momentum despite strong European economic data. \par \par \uc2  "I'm extremely worried by this failed attempt on the upside, especially at the beginning of the year," said Gilles Borrel, head of treasury sales at Westdeutsche Landesbank in Paris. "It's deja vu. A lot of wishful thinking, but it's very dodgy." \par \par \uc2  The European single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  started the year's trading on an upbeat note, rising more than a cent to a two-week high of $1.0185 in thin Asian business, after European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim Duisenberg's comments on Sunday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had the potential to appreciate. \par \par \uc2  Duisenberg also said he expected European growth this year to be faster than growth in the United States. \par \par \uc2  But by early European afternoon, the euro had given back a full cent to dangle within a cent of the psychologically crucial parity level. \par \par \uc2  What was worrying, traders said, was the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tendency in recent months to ignore positive European economic data. The euro zone purchasing managers index rose to 57.4 in December, the highest in survey history, from 57.0 in November. \par \par \uc2  The data came after similar strong figures in German and French PMI data, which in turn followed comments earlier by Bank of France Governor Jean-Claude Trichet, who echoed Duisenberg's comments that the euro had the potential to appreciate. \par \par \uc2  Traders said it was too early in the year to make a judgment about the euro's trend, particularly with most of London traders yet to return from the New Years break. \par \par \uc2  "We still haven't seen flows of any substance, but people's view on the euro could change if it sustains its gains from here," said Akira Hoshino, chief trader at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi in London. \par \par \uc2  But Hoshino added that he was still not convinced about a reversal, even though European economic data were improving. \par \par \uc2  Besides European growth prospects, Russian President Boris Yeltsin's surprise resignation last week was seen supporting the euro in early trade. \par \par \uc2  "The fact that Yeltsin has gone at last is also seen as a bonus... The volatility and uncertainty associated with Russia could calm down," said Kevin Ralph, first vice president at Sanwa Bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was broadly softer partly due to unwinding of year-end safe-haven buying, slipping to one-week lows below 102 yen against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But wariness about possible Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cushioned dollar/yen's decline, traders said. \par \par \uc2  While previous rounds of BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  have not clearly halted the dollar's decline, caution prevailed ahead of a Group of Seven deputy finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors meeting in Japan next week. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dw1301hzj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
