\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar up in U.S., trade thins for Christmas. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Svea Herbst-Bayliss \par \uc2 794 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Dezember 1999\par 18:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      NEW YORK, Dec 24 (Reuters) - The dollar held modest gains \par \par \uc2  at midday on Friday as traders tidied up for Christmas a few \par \par \uc2  hours after Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interrupted the latest yen \par \par \uc2  buying spree by selling its own \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Many banks have given their customers a noon deadline for \par \par \uc2  trades and so people are now just cleaning up their books a \par \par \uc2  little bit before shutting the doors for Christmas," said Grant \par \par \uc2  Wilson, senior trader at Mellon Bank in Pittsburgh. \par \par \uc2  Shortly after noon (1700 GMT) the dollar traded more than \par \par \uc2  three quarters of a percent firmer against the yen near 102.91 \par \par \uc2  yen in New York, having first erased sharp overnight losses and \par \par \uc2  then trimmed similarly sharp gains. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded 0.31 percent firmer against the euro as \par \par \uc2  the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also up nearly a half percent \par \par \uc2  against the yen. The dollar was also firmer against the Swiss \par \par \uc2  franc and British pound. \par \par \uc2  Trading volumes, already thin at the start, dried up even \par \par \uc2  more in the last hour, reported several dealers who remained at \par \par \uc2  their desks. \par \par \uc2      "I had five trades today and that was a lot compared with \par \par \uc2  the guys I spoke with," one New York traders said. \par \par \uc2      Overnight, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged a surprise Christmas \par \par \uc2  Eve \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , buying an estimated $1 billion to $2 billion \par \par \uc2  for yen starting below the 102 yen level. This helped the \par \par \uc2  dollar surge to 103.15 yen, its highest level this week. \par \par \uc2  During most of the New York day, the dollar hovered just \par \par \uc2  below 103 yen, failing to break higher but also well supported \par \par \uc2  above 102.50 yen where dealers has suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  activity earlier. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials have long warned about the damaging \par \par \uc2  effects an overly strong yen could have on Japan's fragile \par \par \uc2  economic recovery, and recently dropped more hints that they \par \par \uc2  would not stand by as the yen races ahead. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the 13th round since June, appeared \par \par \uc2  ineffective because the dollar did not hold all of its gains, \par \par \uc2  but it helped sap an already listless market's appetite for \par \par \uc2  more action. \par \par \uc2  "Trading is now very quiet and there is no compelling \par \par \uc2  reason to push anything in any particular direction. We are \par \par \uc2  seeing some position adjustments and then everyone will go \par \par \uc2  home," said Jeffrey Yu, senior trader at Sanwa Bank in New \par \par \uc2  York. \par \par \uc2  Looking ahead to 2000, traders remain confident the dollar \par \par \uc2  will hit 100 yen amid renewed interest for Japanese assets, the \par \par \uc2  beginning of the yearly funds repatriation for Japanese \par \par \uc2  corporations and improving economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2      "The BOJ is resigned to the fact that the yen is going to \par \par \uc2  get stronger in January but they did not want it to go too far \par \par \uc2  ... before the end of the year," said Steven Saywell, market \par \par \uc2  analyst at Fuji in London. \par \par \uc2      The euro was holding just above 104 yen after having been \par \par \uc2  boosted nearly one percent to this week's high of 104.56 in the \par \par \uc2  wake of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Euro/yen strength was keeping the euro propped above $1.01, \par \par \uc2  although the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was still below six-day \par \par \uc2  highs around $1.0180 set on Thursday. \par \par \uc2      The euro was aided a little bit as the region's stock \par \par \uc2  markets performed well with the Paris CAC-40 hitting its 37th \par \par \uc2  record of the year, closing up 2.11 percent at 5852.5 points. \par \par \uc2  London's FTSE rose 0.44 percent to 6806.5 points. \par \par \uc2  Chartists said the euro had yet to tackle key chart \par \par \uc2  barriers above $1.02 to prove parity was definitely out of the \par \par \uc2  picture. \par \par \uc2  "I would not tell people to get excited about this until \par \par \uc2  we take out levels like $1.0225, $1.0250 or even $1.03," said \par \par \uc2  Steve Wesiak, technical strategist at ABN AMRO in Amsterdam. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  prices at 1937 GMT. All data taken from Reuters with \par \par \uc2  percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close at \par \par \uc2  2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab     Last     US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1998\par \tab \tab \tab     Cls\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab  23 Dec.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Euro/dlr\tab \tab    1.0126   1.0159   -0.32  -13.61   1.1721\par  Dlr/yen\tab \tab     102.92   102.00   +0.90   -9.08   113.20\par  Euro/yen\tab \tab    104.15   103.60   +0.53  -21.00   131.84\par  Dlr/swiss\tab \tab   1.5855   1.5805   +0.32  +15.44   1.3735\par  Stg/dlr\tab \tab     1.6156   1.616