\par\par \b \uc2  Yen bulls seen resuming battle with BOJ in New Yr. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Swaha Pattanaik \par \uc2 518 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Dezember 1999\par 12:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Dec 24 (Reuters) - Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the foreign exchanges on Friday is expected to prevent the yen JPY=) from rallying beyond the key 100 level against the dollar in 1999 but bulls are expected to resume the fight in the New Year. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan kept up its six-month battle against the strength of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by hitting liquidity-starved markets with sales of yen for dollars a day before Christmas. \par \par \uc2  Nervousness about taking on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  when so many traders are away on holiday means bulls have, for the time being, given up hope of driving dollar/yen to double-digit levels for the first time in four years. \par \par \uc2  But traders are just adding this target to their list of New Year's resolutions, given the failure of past \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen strength and expectations that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economic recovery will keep luring foreign money into its rallying stock market. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ got more bang for its buck because of the thin markets but once we get to the New Year, the market will push dollar/yen through 100," said Ian Morris, international economist at HSBC Markets in London. \par \par \uc2  "Capital flows into Japan and the fact that the Japanese economic recovery looks increasingly secure means they are just battling against fundamentals." \par \par \uc2  BULLS LITTLE CHECKED BY \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has now \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell yen at least 13 times since June, including once through the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and once through the U.S. Federal Reserve. \par \par \uc2  However, the yen has strengthened 18 percent against the dollar during that time, scaling four-year peaks of 101.22 on November 26 which it came close to breaching on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been deployed each time the yen has strengthened towards these peaks in the past month, highlighting Japan's determination to keep its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  away from the psychological 100 level against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "There is a feeling that if the dollar breaks below 100 (yen), the decline could accelerate and this is what the authorities would be concerned about," said Mark Cliffe, chief economist at ING Barings in London. \par \par \uc2  This view was reinforced after Japan was reported on Friday as saying it intends to ask other members of the Group of Seven nations to reaffirm their concern about the strong yen during a January meeting of the Group's finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors. \par \par \uc2  However, the failure of Friday's BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the dollar much more than a yen despite thin market conditions highlighted the risk that yen bulls would get their way in the New Year, barring an unexpected downturn in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economy, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "Given the liquidity, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should have had much more impact and just goes to show that there are plenty of people waiting to use \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars at better levels," said Johnathan Bayley, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Paribas in Paris. \par \par \uc2  "It is only a matter of time before dollar/yen goes through 100." \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvco07p8h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
