\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar up nearly one yen on BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tamawa Kadoya \par \uc2 669 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Dezember 1999\par 07:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TOKYO, Dec 24 (Reuters) - The dollar rose about one yen\tab   by late Tokyo trade on Friday as Japanese authorities delivered an early Christmas present to corporations and others fearful of further yen strength - and a slap to yen bulls.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Bank of Japan (BOJ), acting as the government's agent, bought dollars in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets from around 102 yen, boosting the greenback briefly to a high of 103.10 yen. Senior \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  official Haruhiko Kuroda confirmed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Kuroda had warned: "We will take decisive steps if needed... You can't assume (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will not take place because it's Christmas Eve." \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a big Japanese trading house said, "It doesn't take much to push the dollar higher in thin trading conditions." \par \par \uc2  But a decisive break in the dollar above 103 yen was hampered as Japanese investors and exporters showed renewed selling interest, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  DOLLAR GAINS LIMITED \par \par \uc2  Selling orders from Japanese investors and exporters were detected on the dollar's rise above 103 yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Selling demand around 103 yen, mostly from Japanese investors, was huge...especially in the afternoon after the MOF confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a trust bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  But the government's efforts to stem the yen's rise made dealers wary of chasing the dollar below 102 yen and 102.50 yen, they said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar had fallen to a low of 101.33 yen overnight, close to the year's low of 101.25 yen. Financial markets in Tokyo were closed on Thursday for a national holiday. \par \par \uc2  ACTION UNDERSCORES \b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 'S RESOLVE \par \par \uc2  "(The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) was a chance for the MOF to show its resolve in stemming sharp yen rises when there is still some liquidity in the market," a dealer at a major city bank said. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa said on Friday that Japan must act against speculative moves out of consideration of a quick recovery in the Japanese economy. \par \par \uc2  Miyazawa said the ministry cannot feel at ease despite the year-end holiday season. There is a view that Japanese authorities are fearful that the yen's rise above 100 yen to the dollar would hurt corporate profits and dampen sentiment until a self-sustainable recovery emerges. \par \par \uc2  However, it may become increasingly difficult for them to take action in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market because of falling liquidity as most banks take precautions and refrain from trade due to possible computer-related problems in the crossover to the new millennium. \par \par \uc2  EURO BOOSTED VS YEN \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro received a boost against the yen\tab     , holding above 104 yen by late Tokyo trade as the dollar was supported against the yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But selling by Japanese accounts also kept gains in the euro's gains in check, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Elsewhere, the euro was slightly lower against the dollar\tab   in lacklustre trade, but clung to around half a cent of overnight gains after largely corporate and options demand pormpted short-covering in a very thin market. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 8027 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bid prices at 0642GMT.  All data taken from Reuters\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with percent change calculated from the daily U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par close at 2130 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab      Last     US Close  % Chg   YTD %  1998 Cls\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   23 Dec.\par \tab \tab \tab      -----------------------------------------\par  Euro/dlr\tab \tab     1.0126   1.0159   -0.32   -13.61   1.1721\par  Dlr/yen\tab \tab      102.74   102.00   +0.73   -13.61   113.20\par  Euro/yen\tab \tab     104.05   103.60   +0.43    -9.24   131.84\par  Dlr/swiss\tab \tab    1.5832   1.5805   +0.17   +15.27   1.3735\par  Stg/dlr\tab \tab      1.6153   1.6160   -0.04    -2.33   1.6539\par  Can/dlr\tab \tab      1.4710   1.4690   +0.14    -3.82   1.5295\par  Aus/dlr\tab \tab      0.6427   0.6458   -0.48    +5.10   0.6115\par  Euro/swiss\tab \tab   1.6036   1.6045   -0.06    -0.51   1.6119\par  Euro/stg\tab \tab     0.6267   0.6270   -0.05   -10.74   0.7021.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvco07ofl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
