\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen runs out of steam after early uptick. \b0\par\par\uc2 625 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 1999\par 04:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE, Dec 23 (Reuters) - The yen\tab     held its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ground against the dollar and the euro in Thursday morning\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Asian trade, but dealers said flows had slowed to a trickle as \par \par \uc2  a holiday in Japan dampened already thin year-end markets. \par \par \uc2      Optimism about Japan's economy remained intact and analysts \par \par \uc2  said the Nikkei's bullish tone was likely to fuel further gains \par \par \uc2  in the yen. \par \par \uc2      But traders expected the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make slow \par \par \uc2  progress in a market driven almost entirely by customer orders \par \par \uc2  with most players reluctant to take fresh positions as the year \par \par \uc2  draws to a close. \par \par \uc2      "We'll have to wait until the new year, when we've seen how \par \par \uc2  Japan weathers the Y2K problem, before we can really see which \par \par \uc2  way the yen is headed," said Marshall Gittler, head of the \par \par \uc2  global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk group, Asia at Bank of America in Hong \par \par \uc2  Kong. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the yen might have trouble firming beyond the \par \par \uc2  key 101.20 level against the dollar during the Asian session, \par \par \uc2  given the lack of liquidity and lingering wariness of Bank of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      "They're not really that worried about the BOJ but of \par \par \uc2  course you don't want to be caught in a market that's thin like \par \par \uc2  this," said a European bank dealer. \par \par \uc2      He added that the impact of any dollar buying \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \par \par \uc2  the BOJ was likely to be limited as long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  continued to sterilise its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      "People will just treat any blip up in the dollar as a \par \par \uc2  selling opportunity," he said. \par \par \uc2      Analysts said the BOJ was only likely to get aggressively \par \par \uc2  involved if the yen showed signs of strengthening beyond the \par \par \uc2  100 barrier. \par \par \uc2      "I think they're keen to prevent any breakout that would \par \par \uc2  gather momentum, so if it does look to be going through the \par \par \uc2  psychological 100 level, I think they would come in," Bank of \par \par \uc2  America's Gittler told Reuters Television. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/yen\tab      was making even slower progress after\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par getting to within a stone's throw of its lifetime low around\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 102.08 in New York overnight.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Spreads had widened out beyond 10 ticks, reflecting an even\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par greater reluctance to trade the cross.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Talk of options-related bids and orders from Japanese funds\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were likely to keep the euro supported above 102.10 yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The euro\tab     was little changed against the dollar as\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par traders focused on the yen, predicting a $1.0075-$1.0120 range\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the euro.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     For full report on major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  click on\tab \par     For previous updates on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves click on\tab \par \f28 \p