\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro hovers perilously above lows. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Elizabeth Lazarowitz \par \uc2 841 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1999\par 16:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      NEW YORK, Dec 2 (Reuters) - Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was on \par \par \uc2  knife's edge on Thursday, hovering just above record lows hit \par \par \uc2  against the dollar overnight, after Europe's top central banker \par \par \uc2  failed to throw the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  a lifeline. \par \par \uc2  The euro wobbled sideways, then eased lower after European \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim Duisenberg repeated that the euro \par \par \uc2  had potential to appreciate but failed to say whether the bank \par \par \uc2  would take action to support it through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "He's not really saying anything new," said Paul Podolsky, \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at BankBoston, adding, "He certainly does \par \par \uc2  not have the faith of the market enough for people to buy the \par \par \uc2  euro on anything he says." \par \par \uc2  The euro EUR=) had zigzagged dramatically overnight, \par \par \uc2  falling to a trough of $1.0023, the lowest level since its \par \par \uc2  debut in January of this year, and then bouncing to session \par \par \uc2  highs over $1.01. \par \par \uc2      Dealers say the euro is likely to reach parity with the \par \par \uc2  dollar  in the near term. "Parity's a done deal, it seems to \par \par \uc2  me. It's   just a question of when," said Podolsky. \par \par \uc2      In U.S. morning trading, the euro was pinned above its low \par \par \uc2  in the $1.0040 area, down from $1.0076 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      Duisenberg, speaking after the ECB announced it was leaving \par \par \uc2  interest rates and its reference rate for M3 money supply \par \par \uc2  growth alone, said that there were expectations that U.S. \par \par \uc2  growth will slow and European growth will speed up. \par \par \uc2  He added recent \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements between the euro \par \par \uc2  and the dollar were "not inexplicable," but reiterated that the \par \par \uc2  euro has a strong potential to rise. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  remained a tool in the bank's arsenal, he said, but declined to \par \par \uc2  speculate when it might be used. \par \par \uc2      Traders said there was not much new -- or supportive -- in \par \par \uc2  the closely watched comments. \par \par \uc2      "The surprise would have been if Duisenberg had said \par \par \uc2  something bullish on the euro, which would have sparked some \par \par \uc2  short covering. But since he didn't, we went back to where we \par \par \uc2  started, which is around here," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a \par \par \uc2  large U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  The euro had gotten a brief boost just before New York \par \par \uc2  trading got underway after the ECB kept interest rates and its \par \par \uc2  money supply reference value unchanged. \par \par \uc2  Financial markets were particularly attuned to the ECB's \par \par \uc2  decision to leave its M3 target unchanged at 4.5 percent, an \par \par \uc2  action which would tend to reduce pressure for a hike in \par \par \uc2  interest rates, analysts said. \par \par \uc2      Meanwhile, the dollar JPY=)   was pinned in the centre of its \par \par \uc2  tight overnight range against the yen. \par \par \uc2      "We've got a band of resistance between 102.80 and 103.20, \par \par \uc2  which essentially kept the dollar from moving higher last \par \par \uc2  night, so we've basically just traded in a 50-point range," \par \par \uc2  said trader Ben Strauss at Bank Julius Baer. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the dollar's downside was protected as the \par \par \uc2  market remained on guard for more action by Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's ascent. \par \par \uc2      The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  markets on Monday and Tuesday, buying dollars and selling yen. \par \par \uc2      Since then, there has been no sign of the Bank of Japan in \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but Japanese officials set \par \par \uc2  traders' teeth on edge when they expressed displeasure at the \par \par \uc2  yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  Senior Japanese Finance Ministry official Haruhiko Kuroda \par \par \uc2  said overnight on Thursday that the yen's current rise was \par \par \uc2  still excessive and the ministry would take decisive action in \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if necessary. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were expecting that Friday's November U.S. payrolls \par \par \uc2  data would be taking the spotlight and might give the market \par \par \uc2  fresh direction. \par \par \uc2      U.S. economists in a Reuters survey expected payrolls to \par \par \uc2  fall to 226,000 from 310,000 in October. \par \par \uc2      The dollar was modestly firmer against the Swiss franc. \par \par \uc2  Overnight, speculation about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Swiss National \par \par \uc2  Bank, later denied by the SNB, sent the greenback tumbling back \par \par \uc2  from near Monday's decade-long peak at 1.5975 francs. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 1501GMT. All data taken from Reuters \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. \par \par \uc2  close at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab    Last     US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1998\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Cls\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab 01 Dec.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr   EUR=)\tab 1.0044   1.0076   -0.32  -14.31   1.1721\par Dlr/yen    JPY=)\tab 102.48   102.69   -0.20   -9.47   113.20\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/yen   EURJPY=)   102.88   103.53   -0.63  -21.97   131.84\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dlr/swiss  CHF=)\tab 1.5922   1.5879   +0.27  +15.92   1.3735\par Stg/dlr    GBP=)\tab 1.5997   1.6002   -0.03   -3.28   1.6539\par Can/dlr    CAD=)\tab 1.4792   1.4727   +0.44   -3.29   1.5295\par Aus/dlr    AUD=)\tab 0.6321   0.6364   -0.68   +3.37   0.6115\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/swiss EURCHF=)   1.6003   1.6011   -0.05   -0.72   1.6119\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/stg   EURGBP=)   0.6277   0.6302   -0.40  -10.60   0.7021\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((U.S. Financial Markets Desk, 212-859-1607)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvc208utp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
