\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro plumbs to fresh life low in U.S. trade. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Elizabeth Lazarowitz \par \uc2 782 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1999\par 17:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Dec 2 (Reuters) - Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell \par \par \uc2  to a fresh all time low against the dollar in New York trading \par \par \uc2  on Thursday morning, dangling perilously close to numerical \par \par \uc2  parity with the greenback. \par \par \uc2  The euro traded as low as $1.0015, according to Reuters \par \par \uc2  data, handily breaking through its previous life low set at \par \par \uc2  $1.0023 overnight, before paring some losses. \par \par \uc2  The euro has now lost some 14 percent in value from its \par \par \uc2  starting rate when 11 European nations adopted the single \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January. \par \par \uc2  Traders found no fresh factors to push the euro lower, and \par \par \uc2  attributed the latest declines largely to capital movements and \par \par \uc2  the market's desire to see the parity level. \par \par \uc2  "There is nothing new really," explained Refco Group senior \par \par \uc2  analyst Mike Malpede, just a few hours after Europe's top \par \par \uc2  central banker failed to throw the euro a lifeline during a \par \par \uc2  news conference. \par \par \uc2  "(European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim) Duisenberg's \par \par \uc2  comments were a little pathetic because it seems he wants the \par \par \uc2  market to focus on fundamentals but the focus is on capital \par \par \uc2  flows. We have a month before Y2K and that could help the \par \par \uc2  dollar more. (European central bankers) can't stand in front of \par \par \uc2  that" to try and halt the euro's slide, he said. \par \par \uc2  Traders agreed that now it was just matter of time before \par \par \uc2  the euro drops below parity. While some technicians said the \par \par \uc2  move could occur as early as Thursday or Friday, others said \par \par \uc2  thin volumes and the defence of options near that level would \par \par \uc2  slow the decline. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think we'll get there today, there is not enough \par \par \uc2  volume," Malpede said. \par \par \uc2  Overnight the euro had already zigzagged dramatically, \par \par \uc2  falling to $1.0023 and then bouncing to session highs over \par \par \uc2  $1.01. \par \par \uc2  Duisenberg, speaking after the ECB announced it was leaving \par \par \uc2  interest rates and its reference rate for M3 money supply \par \par \uc2  growth alone, said recent \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements between \par \par \uc2  the euro and the dollar were "not inexplicable," but reiterated \par \par \uc2  that the euro has a strong potential to rise. \par \par \uc2  He did warn that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained a tool in the bank's \par \par \uc2  arsenal, but declined to speculate when it might be used. \par \par \uc2  Traders said there was not much new -- or supportive -- in \par \par \uc2  the closely watched comments. \par \par \uc2  "The surprise would have been if Duisenberg had said \par \par \uc2  something bullish on the euro, which would have sparked some \par \par \uc2  short covering. But since he didn't, we went back to where we \par \par \uc2  started, which is around here," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a \par \par \uc2  large U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  Financial markets were particularly attuned to the ECB's \par \par \uc2  decision to leave its M3 target unchanged at 4.5 percent, an \par \par \uc2  action which would tend to reduce pressure for a hike in \par \par \uc2  interest rates, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the dollar was pinned in the centre of its tight \par \par \uc2  overnight range against the yen. \par \par \uc2  "We've got a band of resistance between 102.80 and 103.20, \par \par \uc2  which essentially kept the dollar from moving higher last \par \par \uc2  night, so we've basically just traded in a 50-point range," \par \par \uc2  said trader Ben Strauss at Bank Julius Baer. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the dollar's downside was protected as the \par \par \uc2  market remained on guard for more action by Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's ascent. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  markets on Monday and Tuesday, buying dollars and selling yen. \par \par \uc2  Since then, there has been no sign of the Bank of Japan in \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but Japanese officials set \par \par \uc2  traders' teeth on edge when they expressed displeasure at the \par \par \uc2  yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were expecting that Friday's November U.S. payrolls \par \par \uc2  data would be taking the spotlight and might give the market \par \par \uc2  fresh direction. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 1613GMT. All data taken from \par \par \uc2  Reuters with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. \par \par \uc2  close at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -\tab \tab \tab    Last     US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1998 Cls\par -\tab \tab \tab \tab \tab 01 Dec.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par --------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Euro/dlr\tab \tab 1.0028   1.0076   -0.48  -14.44   1.1721\par -Dlr/yen\tab \tab  102.66   102.69   -0.03   -9.31   113.20\par -Euro/yen\tab \tab 102.86   103.53   -0.65  -21.98   131.84\par -Dlr/swiss\tab      1.5952   1.5879   +0.46  +16.14   1.3735\par -Stg/dlr\tab \tab  1.5984   1.6002   -0.11   -3.36   1.6539\par -Can/dlr\tab \tab  1.4786   1.4727   +0.40   -3.33   1.5295\par -Aus/dlr\tab \tab  0.6324   0.6364   -0.63   +3.42   0.6115\par -Euro/swiss\tab     1.5995   1.6011   -0.10   -0.77   1.6119\par -Euro/stg\tab \tab 0.6271   0.6302   -0.49  -10.68   0.7021.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvc207gs8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
