\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ Hayami Statement Means Unsterilized  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 -NHK \b0\par\par\uc2 166 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 1999\par 02:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Masaru Hayami's unusual statement this morning means that the BOJ has unsterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that it conducted Monday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's NHK News reported Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Hayami issued a written statement saying that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  strongly hopes that that market stability is restored as soon as possible, and declaring that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supports MOF's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank is prepared to promptly provide sufficient funds in order to maintain the stability of the short-term money market, taking account of the government's yen funding of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and any disruptive impact of excessive movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on domestic financial transactions," the statement said. \par \par \uc2  NHK said Hayami effectively said the Bank of Japan is further easing its monetary policy by unsterilizing funds used for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Funds from the BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday, when it sold yen for dollars and euros, settle this session. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvc10887c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscal